# Touch control art (#336, D77): skip, native 64x64. Skip-to-end icon on the pause disc; the outermost outline is white, not navy,
# so the button keeps D76 outline contrast against the black story screen. Hand-authored pixel grid, full frame (the icon is not symmetric).
size 64 64
color k 14122b
color W ffffff
color L fdf3d0
color l d2bf84
color a ffc83a
color A c98a10
color s 3f4670
color S 7480b8
frame skip
